amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920160/extras/696bea796dcf1547605afcacb32a9f97.poster.avif?t=1770200053\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920160/extras/696bea796dcf1547605afcacb32a9f97.webm?t=1770200053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920160/extras/696bea796dcf1547605afcacb32a9f97.mp4?t=1770200053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2>\u2022 <strong>Deep Investigative Immersion:</strong> Thoroughly search every location, interact with objects, find hidden clues, and delve into tragic stories to understand the nature of the entity you\u2019re about to confront.<br>\u2022 <strong>Engaging Puzzles and Mini-games:</strong> Test your skills in varied challenges \u2014 from finding keys to critical areas to reconstructing clues from fragments. Piece the evidence together to draw the right conclusions and advance the case.<br>\u2022 <strong>Gritty \u201980s Atmosphere:</strong> Explore unique, secret-filled locations where unimaginable events unfold. Every interior detail is steeped in the spirit of the era and hides its own story.<br>\u2022 <strong>Hypnosis as an Investigation Tool:</strong> Use Gia\u2019s unique ability to enter characters\u2019 subconscious minds. Peer into their past, uncover repressed trauma, and discover dark secrets that will aid your battle against supernatural forces.<br>\u2022 <strong>Passionate, Explicit Scenes:</strong> Interact with memorable characters \u2014 each with their own personality, history, and\u2026 hidden desires. Uncover their secrets to move the investigation forward.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920160?t=1770200053","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920160?t=1770200053","capsule_image":"https://s